Instance: IMMZ.Persona.Client
InstanceOf: ActorDefinition
Usage: #definition
* status = #draft
* experimental = true
* name = "Client"
* title = "Client"
* type = #person
* description = """
In the context of this document, a client is a person who intends to receive immunization services from the targeted health worker personas. A client who is 15 years of age or younger is considered a child.

**Alternate names**: Vaccinated person.

A related generic persona of the WHO Digital Adaptation Kit for Immunizations.
"""
* documentation = "https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/380303"
